@startuml Pyroform_Data_Flow
title Pyroform Data Flow and Transformations

storage "YAML/JSON Config Files" as ConfigFiles
storage "System State (Live)" as SystemState
database "FlowCTRL Sketch" as FlowSketch
database "Reports (JSON/YAML)" as Reports
rectangle "Pyroform Processing Pipeline" {
  [PyroParser] as Parser
  [Data Models] as Models
  [SketchGenerator] as SketchGen
  [SystemValidator] as Validator
  [PyroflowEngine] as FlowEngine
  [ReportGenerator] as Reporter
}

ConfigFiles --> Parser : reads
Parser --> Models : creates\nPyroConfig objects
Models --> SketchGen : input for\nsketch generation
Models --> Validator : desired state\nfor comparison

SystemState --> Validator : current state\nfor validation
Validator --> Models : creates\nValidationResult

SketchGen --> FlowSketch : writes
FlowSketch --> FlowEngine : executes
FlowEngine --> SystemState : modifies system

Validator --> Reporter : validation results
FlowEngine --> Reporter : execution results
Reporter --> Reports : writes

Models --> Reporter : structured data
SystemState --> Reporter : system state data

@enduml
